{
  "bodyHash": "Sl+uq4OPZCM=",
  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:&amp;#x27\">\n\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/banner-slim.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"透過 Crowdin 翻譯\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>\nImmersive Armors 為遊戲添加了許多友善原版且獨特的盔甲套裝。與無聊的複製貼上盔甲不同，Immersive Armors 專注於視覺增強的盔甲，有些還附帶披風或自訂模型。大多數具有獨家效果，如狂暴模式、反彈、尖刺、神聖護盾等。合成配方已正確註冊於原版配方書中。附魔、修復、染色等功能皆正常運作。\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>40 種新盔甲物品，持續增加中！</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=_immersive_armors:armor&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors/tree/1.20.1&amp;resolution=48&amp;background=fancy&amp;row_size=8\" alt=\"生成的圖集圖片\"></p><p></p>\n\n<h1>木製盔甲</h1>\n<p>我不能代表你，但我已經厭倦了被骷髏射手偷襲。這套原始但有效的盔甲提供了相當不錯的箭矢和爆炸防護。</p>\n<img width=\"450\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/wood.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>骷髏盔甲</h1>\n<p>曾經想過把敵人的骨頭變成盔甲嗎？可能沒有，但這裡有一套輕量型的骷髏盔甲。讓你能移動得更快，凋零骷髏盔甲也是如此。骷髏不再攻擊你。並且會傷害任何試圖碰觸你的東西！</p>\n<img width=\"600\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/skeleton.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>神聖盔甲</h1>\n<p>想要與眾不同嗎？就是這個了，一套華麗的金紅色盔甲。隨心所欲地為布料染色吧。除了外觀好看且擁有卓越的防護力之外，全套神聖盔甲每分鐘能完全抵擋一次攻擊！</p>\n<img width=\"500\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/divine.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>重型盔甲</h1>\n<p>高護甲值、更高的韌性以及幾乎沒有擊退效果，但代價是降低機動性。這套盔甲專為碾壓最強敵人而設計。</p>\n<img width=\"400\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/heavy.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>史萊姆盔甲</h1>\n<p>好吧，我知道這看起來不像盔甲。但相信我，它有用。攻擊你的敵人會被彈開，而且爆炸也不會那麼痛了！不過穿上後你可能會有點味道……</p>\n<img width=\"300\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=300,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/slime.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>戰士盔甲</h1>\n<p>這不只是維京盔甲，穿上它，你就成為了維京人！造成更多斧頭傷害，並根據每點失去的生命值增加整體傷害。進入狂暴模式，在殘酷的近戰中屠殺你的敵人！</p>\n<img width=\"400\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/warrior.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>長袍盔甲</h1>\n<p>蓬鬆、可染色的羊毛盔甲。注入烈焰棒，對任何攻擊你的敵人造成火焰傷害！哦，而且它還防火。因為烈焰棒。科學！</p>\n<img width=\"600\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/robe.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>蒸氣龐克盔甲</h1>\n<p>旋轉的齒輪、黃銅、指南針、時鐘，還有大量煙霧。讓我為你介紹最複雜的盔甲套裝——蒸氣龐克盔甲。頭盔配備了潛行時啟動的敵方雷達系統。胸甲提供增強的 GUI，讓你從此不再錯過時間！護腿配備了雙重跳躍，而靴子則透過整合的蒸汽噴射器完全防止摔落傷害。</p>\n<img width=\"500\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/steampunk.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>海磷石盔甲</h1>\n<p>利用深海守衛的尖刺來獲得優勢！這套尖刺盔甲，嗯，會對攻擊者造成尖刺傷害。雖然堅硬的岩石會減緩你的速度，但它也提供了深海漫遊效果。</p>\n<img width=\"450\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/prismarine.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>影片評論！</h1>\n<p style=\"display:block;font-size:16px;text-align:center;font-family:&amp;#x27\">\n<span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kuGRRFDy7vY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"480\" width=\"836\"></iframe></span></span>\n</p>\n\n<h1>如何合成？</h1>\n<p>\n所有物品都整合到了原版配方書（以及任何像 JEI 的模組）。骨頭、鐵塊、海磷碎片、羊毛、史萊姆球、活塞、皮革盔甲、長袍、凋零骷髏頭顱和木材是解鎖配方所需的物品。\n</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=immersive_armors:.*&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors/tree/1.20.1&amp;resolution=16&amp;animated=False&amp;row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方圖片\"></p><p></p>\n\n<h1>翻譯</h1>\n<p>\nImmersive Armors 已透過機器翻譯成多種語言，但由於翻譯品質通常不佳，歡迎你透過\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>\n參與翻譯工作。\n<br>\n請隨意對不滿意的翻譯投反對票，並提交你的翻譯。\n</p>\n\n<h1>不相容性</h1>\n<p>Epic Fight 模組（盔甲將使用難看的備用模型）</p>\n<p>嘗試以降低透明度來渲染盔甲的模組</p>\n\n<h1>整合</h1>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hostile-humans\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Hostile Humans&amp;description=在你的世界中添加敵對人類與結構&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/586/64/64/638160491085728200.jpeg&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Hostile Humans\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&amp;description=許多獨特且忠於原版的盔甲套裝。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Armors\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&amp;description=一系列用於旅行、運輸和探索的鄉村風格飛行器！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&amp;description=在各種樂器上演奏自訂旋律，並打擾你的朋友！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Melodies\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&amp;description=拖放、像素化並掛上美麗的藝術品。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Paintings\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&amp;description=輕量級的實體刻排程器，可將 TPS 提升一倍。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Optimization\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&amp;description=在不相關時隱藏難看的方塊選擇輪廓線。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&amp;description=為 Immersive Aircraft 設計的一套附加飛行器，並考慮到 Create 支援。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Man of Many Planes\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&amp;description=一系列用於運輸、採礦和自動化的鄉村風格機械。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Machinery\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&amp;description=在遊戲中建立自訂且精美的家具，或從龐大的線上資料庫中選擇。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Furniture\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&amp;description=散佈在主世界中神秘且被遺忘已久的傳送門。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Gateways\">\n</a></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>不喜歡顏色嗎？部分盔甲套裝是可染色的！</p>\n<img width=\"700\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=700,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/dyeable.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/nostalgia-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n截圖中的光影為 Nostalgia Shader\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n</div><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=4c21d6df030e3633f0c59639a39f2560\" alt=\"方便部署頁面的頁面雜湊值。\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
